  vendorName: Quartermaster Hackett
  offerText: The city guard requires your premium bedding. We pay the standard bounty.
    Your floor will clear, but you will sleep on raw wood.
  acceptResultText: They drag away your mattress. The bounty pays well and the room
    feels huge, but your back aches terribly on the hard floor.
  rejectResultText: You refuse. Hackett instantly fines you for 'obstructing civil
    defense' and leaves you in a foul mood.
